elds instead of isDirty in vitals form (#3012)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"9465b6b181bd8e5385cf418b09fcf7a172a1d590","date":"2026-01-05T17:45:17+03:00","message":"(chore) Upgrade TypeScript ESLint to v8 and fix type issues (#2913)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"1cae1653b6f2aa4435310ac356e4170778eb64d0","date":"2025-12-04T08:57:33-05:00","message":"(BREAKING) O3-4961 Workspace v2 migration (#2800)","refs":"","body":"* (feat) O3-4962 store visitContext in patient chart store\n\n* fix immunization-from test failure\n\n* add missing changes\n\n* add e2e test for visit context\n\n* clear visit context when ending or deleting active visit\n\n* migrate visit-context-switcher to use patinet chart store\n\n* fix visit context unset incorrectly when ending active visit\n\n* (BREAKING) Workspace v2 migration\n\n* address PR feedback\n\n* add e2e test steps for visit context when deleting and restoring active visit\n\n* fix unit tests\n\n* fix e2e tests\n\n* update esm-core and fix order basket\n\n* add exported workspaces\n\n* remove unused cancel-order-form\n\n* exported workspaces fixup\n\n* comments\n\n* migrate fill-prescription form workspace\n\n* fix NPE\n\n* fix e2e tests\n\n* address feedback\n\n* Update packages/esm-patient-medications-app/src/routes.json\n\nCo-authored-by: Ian <52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ian <52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com>","authorName":"chibongho","authorEmail":"cbho@pih.org"}],"totalCount":7}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012EJjLUWokiUFcAG37yqRbG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UMPk7L1SwjfborYvKg1nu1","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"04a4cea80c7165fdfeaeb293cee89628d8a46b9e","date":"2026-05-26T16:35:30+03:00","message":"Stub InitializationFilter.startInstallation in E2E tests","refs":"","body":"InitializationFilterE2ETest's wizard-complete tests submit the\nwizardcomplete.vm page to filter.doPost, which calls startInstallation\nand spawns a real InitializationCompletion background thread on the\nshared executor. That thread runs the actual setup using\nwizardModel's default MySQL connection values and eventually calls\nContext.setRuntimeProperties(...), overwriting whatever the next test\nclass set in its constructor.\n\nThe background thread is asynchronous, so it races with subsequent\ntests: SchedulerConfig.dataSource() reads Context.getRuntimeProperties\nat bean-creation time, and when it's clobbered by the wizard's\ndefault values, JobRunr's storageProvider fails to open the H2\nconnection with 'Wrong user name or password'. The race resolves\ndifferently across JVMs (Java 25 happened to pass, Java 21 didn't),\nwhich made it look like flakiness.\n\nMake startInstallation protected and override it in\nTestableInitializationFilter so the wizard-complete tests still\nexercise the page-navigation logic without spawning the real thread.\nThis also reverts the alphabetical surefire runOrder added earlier,\nsince the fix no longer needs a particular test order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","authorName":"dkayiwa","authorEmail":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"600ac3a6b3a48f405074f9eec97b0f40c4a9425f","date":"2014-07-29T13:45:07+03:00","message":"Merge pull request #993 from marvinyan/trunk-4261","refs":"","body":"TRUNK-4261: Error while submitting empty form in the page: \"openmrs/admin/concepts/conceptReferenceTerm.form\"","authorName":"dkayiwa","authorEmail":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"abdfcb0b2719f8d621707c810eed52227c15b55e","date":"2014-07-23T15:29:24-04:00","message":"TRUNK-4261: Error while submitting empty form in the page: \"openmrs/admin/concepts/conceptReferenceTerm.form\"","refs":"","body":"commit 3cb0f3c3a498a2794d17733bcb695f36454af47e\nAuthor: Julius Duic <jpduic1@gmail.com>\nDate:   Wed Jul 23 15:00:55 2014 -0400\n\n    Display multiple form errors when validating\n\ncommit 6037cf3250c9016c46bb2214c6269a025fab024a\nAuthor: Marvin Yan <marvin.yan@outlook.com>\nDate:   Wed Jul 23 14:06:51 2014 -0400\n\n    Add check for null ConceptSource\n","authorName":"Marvin Yan","authorEmail":"marvin.yan@outlook.com"},{"hash":"3fccdc5f33a2990ae6ab9bbbda6b0d08fcd22bbc","date":"2014-07-03T15:31:11+03:00","message":"Merge pull request #973 from rpuzdrowski/TRUNK-4260","refs":"","body":"TRUNK-4260: Error while submitting empty form in the page: openmrs/admin/concepts/conceptSource.form","authorName":"dkayiwa","authorEmail":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"df1cde50e3a3981ba1b05611d659f8d0abcc1b72","date":"2014-07-03T14:23:32+02:00","message":"TRUNK-4260: Error while submitting empty form in the page: openmrs/admin/concepts/conceptSource.form","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Radek Puzdrowski","authorEmail":"radoslaw.puzdrowski@gmail.com"},{"hash":"28eacef7a2eb603cb0d0e93690ae51849a24a3e2","date":"2014-07-02T11:34:30+03:00","message":"Merge pull request #969 from rpuzdrowski/TRUNK-4260","refs":"","body":"TRUNK-4260: Error while submitting empty form in the page: openmrs/admin/concepts/conceptSource.form","authorName":"dkayiwa","authorEmail":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"720103a929963c999625effab7d2de43a1b6465f","date":"2014-06-27T13:19:59+02:00","message":"TRUNK-4260: Error while submitting empty form in the page: openmrs/admin/concepts/conceptSource.form","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Radek Puzdrowski","authorEmail":"radoslaw.puzdrowski@gmail.com"},{"hash":"16ce3878b53cd34e422970732a42d9721fb9a860","date":"2014-04-07T14:03:35+02:00","me